	"en": "Long balls, the ball boy who wastes time, your idol, the trophy in your hands and much more.\n\nWHAT'S NEW\n- YOUR IDOL: pick him at your first Player of the Month and he returns in the tunnel, your locker room or the box.\n- The trophy in your hands: lift it on the parade and the balcony, then place it in your cabinet.\n- LONG BALL: a teammate lofts it to you and you bring it down with foot, thigh, chest or head; in PRACTICE and, now and then, in a match.\n- The nutmeg: tap in time to slip it through his legs to an \"olé!\"; drill it in PRACTICE ▸ NUTMEGS.\n- Away and losing late, the home ball boy keeps the ball to waste time: there's a secret achievement.\n- Score five in a league game and that night a buddy brags on his couch that he had you as fantasy captain.\n- Your careers and legacy are saved to iCloud: reinstall and RESTORE them.\n- PRACTICE: FREE MATCH between any clubs or national teams, CONTROL & VOLLEY and THE TACKLE.\n- TV talks about you: THE FORECAST, HEAD TO HEAD, panel shows, your injury report and the replay desk.\n- New celebrations: robot, surf, cumbia, the guard of honor for goal 100 and the penguin; some wear sunglasses.\n- Shop and locker room: durag, pearls, bum bag, bandanas, sports glasses, backpack, tights and knee pad; 36 haircuts and four brows.\n- In SKILLS, \"-\" removes points you just added; in decline, physical and technique no longer grow.\n- Your club changes owner, hits a crisis or votes; the board moves the league target and sets a finance target.\n- At home you hang and sell shirts and pick the trophies of each cabinet; YOUR STREET has your friends' houses.\n- Cup and super cup of every country (yours too), both English cups and the North American Leagues Cup.\n- Golden Boy gala, World Award, GOAL OF THE YEAR, WORLD ranking, sepia memories and the SEXTUPLE achievement.\n- Stadiums with their club and statue, tifo with flares; second and third tier with sponsors.\n- Finger minigames, THE OFFICIAL PHOTO and controller play; home and NEWS redesigned in landscape.\n- FRIENDS: add them by code, 28-day LEAGUES and challenges; it asks consent, you can delete your account and BLOCK anyone.\n- With your national team: nations league, U-23 and intercontinental; eight positions for your career.\n\nIMPROVEMENTS\n- Entering a match takes three seconds instead of nine, and returning to the hub no longer stutters.\n- Landscape: run with the left stick and pull the right one like a slingshot, with LEFTY mode; 3D no longer gets cut off.\n- The defense drops back when you drive into the box, and you can also shoot from the edge.\n- Clubs weigh your age and awards, every career brings different offers, and from the third tier you climb one division at a time.\n- ASK FOR REST has no cap: the coach decides by your energy and the match, and his \"no\" costs relationship.\n- The awards gala has a new stage, the year review opens with its verdict, and the home screen is tidier.\n- Stars age at their own pace; cups fall on their real dates and the big national-team cup is played in closed stadiums.\n- Cups, awards and numbers written your language's way, 1,200 better translations, plus Turkish and European Portuguese.\n\nFIXES\n- Fewer crashes on 4 GB iPhones: matches use far less memory and caches are cleared in time.\n- Quitting during a shootout no longer loses the match, the first match after installing no longer stutters, and swiping a list opens nothing.\n- Your coach calls up the good wingers and subs in players who know the position; regens learn similar positions.\n- Teammate and top-scorer numbers add up; potential no longer lifts your rating and you can pass 90 at any age.\n- The surname no longer pokes above the collar, and watches and caps show on dark skin.\n- On a teammate's free kick you no longer appear as the taker, and confetti keeps falling during the replay." \
